<title>AUSTRALIA: ASX substantial shareholding notices - July 4.</title>
<headline>ASX substantial shareholding notices - July 4.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following substantial shareholder notices were made</p>
<p>to The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX) yesterday.</p>
<p>Tolric Pty Limited increased its relevant interest in National Textiles Limited on 30/06/1997, from 1,364,161 ordinary shares (11.96%) to 6,714,161 ordinary shares (40.08%).</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>Stratbrook Pty Ltd changed its relevant interest in Rebel Sport Limited on 30/06/1997, from 7,713,150 ordinary shares (19.98%) to 7,713,150 ordinary shares (19.98%).</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
</text>
